I got a comment from a first-year student

541
00:19:52,150 --> 00:19:54,150
I asked her if she went to Asuka-chan's graduation wedding.

542
00:19:54,150 --> 00:19:58,150
She told me that she went too.

543
00:19:58,150 --> 00:20:01,150
I've been to a lot of weddings.

544
00:20:01,150 --> 00:20:04,150
But did you play a role? Did you go to see them?

545
00:20:04,150 --> 00:20:07,150
I didn't go to see her, but I was allowed to go.

546
00:20:07,150 --> 00:20:10,150
I had a hard time answering him.

547
00:20:10,150 --> 00:20:13,150
But he didn't seem to notice me at all.

548
00:20:13,150 --> 00:20:16,150
So, your friends are still the same?

549
00:20:16,150 --> 00:20:17,150
At the university.

550
00:20:17,150 --> 00:20:20,150
I was making julo in the latrine.

551
00:20:20,150 --> 00:20:21,150
It was a sad story.

552
00:20:21,150 --> 00:20:22,150
But then...

553
00:20:22,150 --> 00:20:24,150
I've made progress.

554
00:20:24,150 --> 00:20:27,150
This year we had chilos on the bench

555
00:20:27,150 --> 00:20:29,150
I finally went to the bench.

556
00:20:29,150 --> 00:20:30,150
Alone?

557
00:20:30,150 --> 00:20:31,150
Alone.

558
00:20:31,150 --> 00:20:32,150
That's good.

559
00:20:32,150 --> 00:20:34,150
It's a bench from the bathroom, so there's a big difference.

560
00:20:34,150 --> 00:20:35,150
Yes, it does.

561
00:20:35,150 --> 00:20:36,150
But, you know, toilet to bench.

562
00:20:36,150 --> 00:20:37,150
What?

563
00:20:37,150 --> 00:20:38,150
Well, if you make it a bench.

564
00:20:38,150 --> 00:20:39,150
It's kind of the same thing.

565
00:20:39,150 --> 00:20:40,150
But now that you're out...

566
00:20:40,150 --> 00:20:44,150
I thought it wouldn't look too weird if we stood in line.

567
00:20:44,150 --> 00:20:47,150
I thought it wouldn't look too suspicious if I stood in line.

568
00:20:47,150 --> 00:20:49,150
I buy a little extra.

569
00:20:49,150 --> 00:20:50,150
What?

570
00:20:50,150 --> 00:20:52,150
You have some leftover chilos?

571
00:20:52,150 --> 00:20:54,150
I take them home and eat them.

572
00:20:54,150 --> 00:20:56,150
I'm going to cut some of these into single pieces.

573
00:20:56,150 --> 00:20:57,150
Extra chilos.

574
00:20:57,150 --> 00:20:59,150
That's a sad song.

575
00:20:59,150 --> 00:21:02,150
I'll buy some chilos for my friends.

576
00:21:02,150 --> 00:21:04,150
Wow, Akimoto-san, you're going to do it!

577
00:21:04,150 --> 00:21:06,150
I really think he's going to do it!

